WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.075
What does it check?

2
00:00:01.075 --> 00:00:05.155
Microsoft Learn says it tests
hundreds of items from Microsoft's

3
00:00:05.155 --> 00:00:09.688
configuration guidance for Entra,
Intune, Azure networking and Purview.

4
00:00:09.688 --> 00:00:15.689
Release three point one point oh holds
three hundred sixty-four tests across seven

5
00:00:15.689 --> 00:00:18.558
pillars: identity, devices, network, data,

6
00:00:18.558 --> 00:00:21.776
infrastructure, security
operations, and A I.

7
00:00:21.776 --> 00:00:23.887
The guide names four things it isn't.

8
00:00:23.887 --> 00:00:27.675
It isn't a verdict: a pass
rate isn't a maturity stage.

9
00:00:27.675 --> 00:00:31.200
