outside any Microsoft support program.

12
00:00:41.125 --> 00:00:44.869
And it isn't a detector: Learn's
Global Secure Access guidance

13
00:00:44.869 --> 00:00:48.838
calls it a configuration-posture
check, to be paired with alerts.

14
00:00:48.838 --> 00:00:50.700
In federal terms it's optional.

15
00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:53.517
